    {
      "dataset_id": "on007763",
      "id": "on007763",
      "name": "BCCWJ-MEG",
      "description": "This dataset comprises magnetoencephalography (MEG) recordings from 35 Japanese native speakers who read Japanese newspaper articles word by word, presented via rapid serial visual presentation. It forms part of the BCCWJ-Brain collection, which includes fMRI, MEG, and EEG data from separate participant groups exposed to the same stimuli, enabling cross-modal comparisons of language processing at high spatial and temporal resolution. T1-weighted structural images were also acquired for source localization purposes.",
